{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2491,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.zasten.trader",
  "name": "Zasten",
  "slug": "zasten",
  "teaser": "Adds a new underground trader...",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/sAfLt3adRxWdzbIIPfJoOc6n6RFxAY3UP7UlMQX1.png",
  "downloads": 15372,
  "favourites_count": 16,
  "description": "<p><strong>Zasten adds a late-game black-market trader to SPT with rare and unconventional gear, now featuring loyalty levels and quests.</strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>BUG REPORTING</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>If you run into bugs, report them in the comments with your <strong>SPT version, mod list, and server log.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Future Plans</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>More Quests, custom items, weapon presets</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Dependency for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2512/wtt-content-backport\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT – Content Backport</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Installation</strong>\nInstallation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Select the folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Drag the selected folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>PATCH NOTES — VERSION 2.2</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed Holiday Items &amp; Holiday Trader image</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Quests &amp; Trader Progression</strong></p>\n<p><strong>13 new quests have been added to Zasten</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One full questline is now complete: “Do It My Way”</li>\n<li>More quests and full questlines are in development</li>\n<li>Expanded Loyalty Level progression to improve early-game flow</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Trader Inventory Updates</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Added multiple new items, with a focus on filling out LL1 trader stock</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Early-game offerings now provide more variety while maintaining balance</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>New Item Added\nObdolbos-Z Cocktail Injector</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A modified Obdolbos stimulant available at LL4 Zasten, designed for extreme performance at a lasting cost.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Positive Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Increased stamina recovery</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+60% carry weight</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Strength</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Endurance</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Attention</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Perception</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Negative Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Reduced maximum stamina</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Decreased health regeneration</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Increased hydration drain</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Increased energy drain</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Can be found In Raid Locations</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Dead Scavs</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Medical airdrops</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Lab technician bodies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Medbags &amp; medcases</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Medical supply crates</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
