      "id": 12886,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "2.2.3",
      "description": "<h2>v2.2.3 Patch Notes</h2>\n<hr />\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Added new quest <strong>Recovery Point</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Location-based quest where players must find and mark an item, then survive the raid</li>\n<li>More quests of this type will be added in future updates</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Added <strong>RU</strong> and <strong>ZH</strong> locales\n<ul>\n<li>Quest translations were done using <strong>Google Translate</strong> and may not be 100% accurate</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <strong>trader standing progression values</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Issue caused players becoming stuck at Trader Level 1</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Removed  quest <strong>code names</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated quest images for <strong>Scrap Run</strong> and <strong>Scrap Run 2</strong></li>\n<li>Adjusted values for the latest stim <strong>SJ6X “Blackout”</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduced delay on negative effects from <strong>180 seconds to 90 seconds</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Notes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Please make sure you have <strong>.7z</strong> support installed to download and extract this release</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2491/zasten/2.2.3",
