    {
      "id": 12873,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "2.2.2",
      "description": "<h1>Zasten Mod – Patch Notes v2.2.2</h1>\n<h2>Quest Fixes &amp; Adjustments</h2>\n<h3>Do It My Way – Part 3</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed progression issue where the P90 unlocked at Trader Loyalty Level 3 / PMC Level 27</li>\n<li>P90 now unlocks at Trader Loyalty Level 2</li>\n<li>Allows the weapon to be obtained and used as intended for quest completion</li>\n<li>Updated EN locales for Do It My Way\n<ul>\n<li>Quest text now correctly states “Zasten’s build”</li>\n<li>Clarifies that the weapon must be purchased directly from the trader</li>\n<li>Removes ambiguity and prevents softlocks</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>New End-Game Quest</h2>\n<h3>Chase the Rainbow</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>New high-difficulty end-game quest</li>\n<li>Unlocks at PMC Level 37</li>\n<li>Objective:\n<ul>\n<li>Find and hand over all colored Labs keycards</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Designed as an extremely rare and challenging quest</li>\n<li>Provides high-value rewards and exclusive unlocks</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>New Stim Added</h2>\n<h3>SJ6-X “Blackout”</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Unlocked after completing Chase the Rainbow</li>\n<li>End-game combat stim with powerful short-term benefits and a severe crash phase</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Buffs</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>+45% stamina regeneration for 180 seconds</li>\n<li>+25 maximum stamina for 180 seconds</li>\n<li>Quantum Tunnelling for 45 seconds</li>\n<li>+1 health regeneration for 300 seconds</li>\n<li>Removes all active blood loss effects  for 180 seconds</li>\n<li>+20 Vitality skill rate for 180 seconds</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Post-Stim Crash Effects</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Hands tremor after 45 seconds</li>\n<li>-40% stamina regeneration</li>\n<li>-50% hydration rate</li>\n<li>-50% energy rate</li>\n<li>-10 Metabolism skill rate for 300 seconds</li>\n<li>-5 Health skill rate for 60 seconds</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Summary</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed quest progression and early-game unlock issues</li>\n<li>Improved clarity and reliability of quest requirements</li>\n<li>Added new end-game quest with meaningful difficulty and rewards</li>\n<li>Introduced a high-risk, high-reward exclusive stim</li>\n<li>Improved overall quest stability and reward handling</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2491/zasten/2.2.2",
