    {
      "id": 12800,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "2.2.0",
      "description": "<p><strong>PATCH NOTES — VERSION 2.2</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed Holiday Items &amp; Holiday Trader image</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Quests &amp; Trader Progression</strong></p>\n<p><strong>13 new quests have been added to Zasten</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One full questline is now complete: “Do It My Way”</li>\n<li>More quests and full questlines are in development</li>\n<li>Expanded Loyalty Level progression to improve early-game flow</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Trader Inventory Updates</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Added multiple new items, with a focus on filling out LL1 trader stock</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Early-game offerings now provide more variety while maintaining balance</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>New Item Added\nObdolbos-Z Cocktail Injector</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A modified Obdolbos stimulant available at LL4 Zasten, designed for extreme performance at a lasting cost.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Positive Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Increased stamina recovery</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+60% carry weight</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Strength</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Endurance</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Attention</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>+30 Perception</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Negative Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Reduced maximum stamina</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Decreased health regeneration</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Increased hydration drain</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Increased energy drain</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Can be found In Raid Locations</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Dead Scavs</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Medical airdrops</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Lab technician bodies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Medbags &amp; medcases</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Medical supply crates</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>If you are experiencing <strong>issues,</strong> or want to <strong>suggest items, quests, balance changes, or features to be added to the mod</strong>, please write them in the comments. I read them all and take suggestions into consideration!</p>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2491/zasten/2.2.0",
