      "description": "<p><strong>HOTFIX</strong></p>\n<p><strong>REQUIRES SPT 4.0.8 NOTHING BELOW</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Adjusted item stock to unlimited with purchase restrictions, displaying “A Lot” instead of a fixed quantity</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Updated purchase limits on select gun attachments</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fixed RSASS price to $4000 USD (previously shown as €4000)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Adjusted thermal prices to better align with the presets they are included with</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Resolved server startup warnings:\n“No valid item configs found”\n“No CustomWeaponPresets files found”</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Upcoming</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Quest development has begun, with some basic quests already functional</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Additional quests will be added prior to release</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Loyalty levels will be implemented alongside quest progression</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Custom stims are currently in development</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
