      "version": "2.1.0",
      "description": "<p>Patch Notes\n<strong>REQUIRES SPT 4.0.8 NOTHING BELOW</strong></p>\n<p>Important</p>\n<p><strong>NOW REQUIRES WTT CommonLib</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2310/wtt-commonlib\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2310/wtt-commonlib</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Added</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>New RSASS and SCAR-H weapon presets</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Couple Christmas-themed items</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Changed / Fixed</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Updated file structure to properly support Mod Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Trader portrait updated for the holidays (I just added a santa hat lol)\nYou may need to clear your temp logs for the new image to appear</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Notes</p>\n<p><strong>On server startup, you may see messages such as:</strong></p>\n<p>“No valid item configs found”</p>\n<p>“No CustomWeaponPresets files found”</p>\n<p>These messages are expected and harmless.\nZasten does not include custom items or quests yet, these systems are intentionally pre-enabled for future updates.</p>\n<p><strong>Quests and LL will be in the next update probably in a couple of weeks,  Might do an assort update first with a couple fixes</strong></p>\n",
