    {
      "id": 12569,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "description": "<p>Small Update</p>\n<p>This update includes a major overhaul of the trader’s structure and item definitions.\nAll item hex IDs have been regenerated and the entire assort has been cleaned up for better readability and long-term stability.</p>\n<p>What’s New</p>\n<p>• Added several new magazines, ammo types, an armored rig, and new barters.</p>\n<p>• Fully reorganized and cleaned up the assort structure.</p>\n<p>• All hex IDs were replaced with a new standardized format.</p>\n<p>• Fixed AS VAL, Mk18, and P90 durability to properly spawn at 100.</p>\n<p>What’s Next</p>\n<p>• New custom weapon presets coming in the next update.</p>\n<p>• Additional special items, including coded items for map-specific extracts.</p>\n<p>• Full questline and loyalty levels planned for a future release.</p>\n",
      "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2491/zasten/2.0.0",
